{'symbol': 'VRSK', 'date': '2022-07-21 16:15:00', 'title': 'VERISK NAMES ELIZABETH MANN CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER', 'text': 'JERSEY CITY, N.J., JULY 21, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- VERISK (NASDAQ: VRSK) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ELIZABETH MANN HAS BEEN NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER FOR VERISK, EFFECTIVE SEPTEMBER 15, 2022.'}